<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Independence.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Independence.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	  Independence Brewing Co</p>
<p>   Priced At					  $6</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			  900,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter		AS Goldmen &amp; Co</p>
<p>NOTE: The company proposed also four million warrants.</p>
<p>	    The company, based in California, produces</p>
<p>craft-brewed ales, lagers, porters and beers.</p>
